  THREE OPEN OPERATOR DECISIONS, none of which are code defects:
    1. safety_buffer_pct is on st_rate but not lt_rate. This is why 1256 blends
       to 26.0% and not 27.2%. Unresolved on purpose - it re-rates every
       long-term gain in the ledger, so it is a decision, not a fix.
    2. 1256 year-end mark-to-market is not modelled and UNDER-reserves. Only
       matters if CME contracts are held across Dec 31. If they will be, this
       needs building BEFORE year end.
    3. If the basis harvester ever placed a live spot leg before Round 24, that
       fill may be on the wrong market. Reconcile actual fills before trusting
       any historical P&L from it.

